  "body": "This isn't just a home; it's a versatile seaside sanctuary with limitless potential. Whether you are looking for a beautiful residence, a high-performing rental, or a future project site, this property offers a rare combination of lifestyle and long-term value.\r\n\r\nWhy This is a Must-Buy:\r\n• Million-Dollar Views: Enjoy uninterrupted, panoramic vistas of Rangitoto Island from your living room.\r\n• Ready to Enjoy: The existing home is move-in ready, featuring a modern kitchen and renovated bathroom.\r\n• Airbnb Goldmine: With its prime location and stunning views, this is a perfect candidate for a high-yield short-term rental.\r\n• Room to Grow: Explore the potential to add a 3rd bedroom or a luxurious master ensuite (subject to council approval) to immediately add value.\r\n• Prime Location: A flat, 5-minute stroll to the golden sands of Browns Bay beach and vibrant local shops.\r\n• Elite Schooling: Zoned for the best: Browns Bay School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n• Future Proof: Sitting on a 696m² THAB-zoned site, the option to eventually bowl and build your dream home remains a powerful asset.\r\n\r\nIgnore the CV – The Vendor is Moving! \r\n\r\nThe owner is 100% committed to selling and has issued clear instructions: This must be sold!\r\n\r\nNote: Any additions or structural changes are subject to council approval.",
